Subject: [PATCH 1/2] docs(process): a P1-P9 priority scale replaces P0/P1/P2;
 PROCESS_VERSION 27

AGENTS.md gets a "Priorities" section (nine levels, filing rules) and every
rule that named P0/P1/P2 is updated; skills, README and the decision file
(with the one-shot migration script, not run) follow.

Refs #1189 (closes with the PR)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
